{"abstract":"In this document, the Federal Communications Commission (Commission or FCC) acts on its proposal to retarget universal service funding for mobile broadband and voice in the high-cost program to support the deployment of 5G services by establishing the 5G Fund for Rural America as a replacement for the Mobility Fund Phase II and adopting the basic framework for implementing the 5G Fund.","action":"Final rule.","agencies":[{"raw_name":"FEDERAL COMMUNICATIONS COMMISSION","name":"Federal Communications Commission","id":161,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/federal-communications-commission","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/161","parent_id":null,"slug":"federal-communications-commission"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2020/11/25/2020-24486.html","cfr_references":[{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"1","title":47},{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"54","title":47}],"citation":"85 FR 75770","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"Effective December 28, 2020, except for Sec. Sec. 1.21001(b)(1), 1.21001(b)(2), 1.21001(b)(3), 1.21001(b)(4), 1.21001(b)(5), 1.21001(b)(6), 1.21001(b)(7), 1.21001(b)(8), 1.21001(b)(9), 1.21001(b)(10), 1.21001(b)(11), 1.21001(b)(12), 1.21001(b)(13), 1.21001(e), 1.21002(e), 1.21002(f), 54.313(n), 54.322(b), 54.322(c)(4), 54.322(g), 54.322(h), 54.322(i), 54.322(j), 54.1014(a), 54.1014(b)(2), 54.1016(b), 54.1018(a), 54.1018(b), 54.1018(c), 54.1019(a)(1), 54.1019(a)(2), 54.1019(a)(3), 54.1019(a)(4), 54.1020(a), 54.1020(b), 54.1020(c)(1), and 54.1020(c)(2), which are delayed and for which we will publish a document in the Federal Register announcing the effective date.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["GN Docket No. 20-32","FCC 20-150","FRS 17211"],"dockets":[],"document_number":"2020-24486","effective_on":"2020-12-28","end_page":75828,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_order_n